Code ported from upstream. server/webclient/headless/leanclient.ts and the decode helpers next to it port the login
handshake, the player/npc info decoders and the movement code of server/webclient/src (Client.ts, ClientPlayer.ts,
ClientEntity.ts and related files), MIT, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Lost City.

Game data. sdk/navgrid/navgrid.bin, sdk/collision-data.bin and the JSON tables under sdk/navgrid/ and
server/webclient/headless/data/ are derived from the rev-289 game cache and scripts that rs-sdk ships
(server/content); the extractors that rebuild them are included (see GUIDE.md "Navgrid").

